WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
But this is how we will ensure that the system works

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.840
for everyone and is sustainable into the future.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.540
We're also using tariffs to defend our sovereignty

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:11.080
and security throughout the world,

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:13.620
including against nations that have taken advantage

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:17.020
of former U.S. administrations for decades,

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.020
including...

